"able to read in some a particularly exotic trajectory file type. If you do "
"need to work with these other types of file can get the molfile plugins by "
"downloading the SOURCE of VMD. This sourcecode contains a plugins directory."
" You will need to adapt the build.sh script within this directory and then "
"compile the code within the directory. Once this process is completed you "
"should get the molfile plugins compiled as a static library called "
"<code>libmolfile_plugin.a</code>. The location of this library, the "
"<code>libmolfile_plugin.h</code> and the <code>molfile_plugin.h</code> "
"include files will then need to be passed to configure using a command "
"similar to:</p>"
